@Stb.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5138

### Users
GET {{Stb.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Create User
POST {{Stb.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "userfirstname": "Test",
  "email": "test@stb.local",
  "mobile": "2222222222",
  "password": "pass123",
  "role": "User"
}

### Demandes
GET {{Stb.Api_HostAddress}}/api/demandes
Accept: application/json

### Create Demande
POST {{Stb.Api_HostAddress}}/api/demandes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestType": "Support technique",
  "requestSubType": "Connexion réseau",
  "description": "Problème de connexion",
  "userId": 1
}

### Notifications by user
GET {{Stb.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notifications?userId=1
Accept: application/json

